    "sentence_translations": [
      "You are what you eat",
      "",
      "Paul sprained his left foot when playing basketball.",
      "His friend Xiao Ming knew he was in pain and invited him for dinner at his home.",
      "When Paul arrived at Xiao Ming’s home, he saw a big earthenware cooking pot on the table.",
      "Paul asked Xiao Ming: “Such a big pot! What’s inside?”",
      "Xiao Ming said: “Pig’s trotters and chicken feet. My mom said you are what you eat.”",
      "“If you eat these your foot will recover quicker!”"
    ]
  }
